  +'lean\n"'#10'"    Check if Input matches the regex Pattern. Case-insensitive'
  +'.\n"'#10'"  ExtractBetween(S, StartMarker, EndMarker) : string\n"'#10'"    '
  +'Extract the substring of S between StartMarker and EndMarker.\n"'#10'"\n"'
  +#10'"JSON functions (use a handle returned by JSONParse):\n"'#10'"  JSONPars'
  +'e(S) : Integer\n"'#10'"    Parse a JSON string and return a handle (>=0). R'
  +'eturns -1 on error.\n"'#10'"  JSONFree(Handle)\n"'#10'"    Release the hand'
  +'le after use.\n"'#10'"  JSONGetString(Handle, Path) : string\n"'#10'"    Ge'
