  +'"Live time"'#10'msgstr "Tiempo de vida"'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labe'
  +'linitparameters.caption'#10'msgid "Parameters name=regexp are extracted fro'
  +'m the response and used by name in requests"'#10'msgstr "Los par'#195#161'm'
  +'etros name=regexp se extraen de la respuesta y se utilizan por su nombre en'
  +' las solicitudes"'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labelinitparameters1.capti'
  +'on'#10'msgid "Time in seconds to refresh parameters with a new request (0 ='
  +' every request)"'#10'msgstr "Tiempo en segundos para actualizar los par'#195
  +#161'metros con una nueva solicitud (0 = cada solicitud)"'#10#10'#: tformcon'
  +'figtrayslate.labelinitparameters2.caption'#10'msgctxt "tformconfigtrayslate'
  +'.labelinitparameters2.caption"'#10'msgid "Parameters"'#10'msgstr "Par'#195
  +#161'metros"'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labelinitparameters4.caption'#10
  +'msgid "Parameters in the form key=value used by {key} in requests. If the v'
  +'alue is omitted (key=), it will be requested from the user."'#10'msgstr "Pa'
  +'r'#195#161'metros en formato key=value utilizados por {key} en las solicitu'
  +'des. Si se omite el valor (key=), se solicitar'#195#161' al usuario."'#10#10
  +'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labelinitparemeters.caption'#10'msgid "Initial GET '
  +'request to obtain required parameters."'#10'msgstr "Solicitud GET inicial p'
  +'ara obtener los par'#195#161'metros necesarios."'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrays'
  +'late.labeliniturl.caption'#10'msgctxt "tformconfigtrayslate.labeliniturl.ca'
  +'ption"'#10'msgid "URL"'#10'msgstr "URL"'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labe'
  +'linituseragent.caption'#10'msgctxt "tformconfigtrayslate.labelinituseragent'
  +'.caption"'#10'msgid "User Agent"'#10'msgstr "User Agent"'#10#10'#: tformcon'
  +'figtrayslate.labellanguages.caption'#10'msgid "Supported languages e.g. en='
  +'en-US (en - internal, en-US - service). \"empty\" - do not send."'#10'msgst'
  +'r "Idiomas admitidos, por ejemplo, en=en-US (en - interno, en-US - servicio'
  +'). \"empty\" - no enviar."'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labellanguages1.c'
  +'aption'#10'msgid "Value type for populating names. None keeps originals; No'
  +'ne and Unit are case-sensitive."'#10'msgstr "Tipo de valor para rellenar no'
  +'mbres. None conserva los originales; None y Unit distinguen entre may'#195
  +#186'sculas y min'#195#186'sculas."'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labellang'
  +'uagestarget.caption'#10'msgid ""'#10'"Target languages e.g. en=en-US, en - '
  +'internal, en-US - service code.\n"'#10'"If not specified, both source and t'
  +'arget languages are taken from the languages section."'#10'msgstr ""'#10'"I'
  +'diomas de destino, por ejemplo, en=en-US, en - interno, en-US - c'#195#179
  +'digo de servicio.\n"'#10'"Si no se especifica, tanto los idiomas de origen '
  +'como los de destino se toman de la secci'#195#179'n de idiomas."'#10#10'#: '
  +'tformconfigtrayslate.labelmaxlength.caption'#10'msgid "Max Length, bytes"'
  +#10'msgstr "Longitud m'#195#161'xima, bytes"'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.'
  +'labelmethod.caption'#10'msgid "Method"'#10'msgstr "M'#195#169'todo"'#10#10
  +'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labelparemeters.caption'#10'msgid "Use parameters: '
  +'{text} '#226#128#147' input text, {source} '#226#128#147' source language, '
  +'{target} '#226#128#147' target language. Prefix the name with ! for lowerca'
  +'se or ^ for uppercase value. Also supported {timestamp}, {rand}. Use {param'
  +'eter} from the parameters page."'#10'msgstr "Utilice par'#195#161'metros: {'
  +'text} '#226#128#147' texto de entrada, {source} '#226#128#147' idioma de or'
  +'igen, {target} '#226#128#147' idioma de destino. Anteponga ! para valor en '
  +'min'#195#186'sculas o ^ para valor en may'#195#186'sculas. Tambi'#195#169'n'
  +' se admiten {timestamp}, {rand}. Utilice {parameter} de la p'#195#161'gina '
  +'de par'#195#161'metros."'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labelpostdata.capti'
  +'on'#10'msgid "Post Data"'#10'msgstr "Post Data"'#10#10'#: tformconfigtraysl'
  +'ate.labelpostdata1.caption'#10'msgctxt "tformconfigtrayslate.labelpostdata1'
