  +' tformconfigtrayslate.labelmethod.caption'#10'msgid "Method"'#10'msgstr "'
  +#235#169#148#236#132#156#235#147#156'"'#10#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labelp'
  +'aremeters.caption'#10'msgid "Use parameters: {text} '#226#128#147' input te'
  +'xt, {source} '#226#128#147' source language, {target} '#226#128#147' target'
  +' language. Prefix the name with ! for lowercase or ^ for uppercase value. A'
  +'lso supported {timestamp}, {rand}. Use {parameter} from the parameters page'
