  +#208#181#208#189#208#181#208#189#208#184#209#143'?"'#10#10'#: formconfig.rre'
  +'sponsehint'#10'msgid ""'#10'"Json Pointer: Use / for levels, keys for objec'
  +'ts, and numbers for indexes.\n"'#10'"Use * for all items, *#10 to join item'
  +'s by newline. Use ~ at the end of the path to return the raw JSON branch.\n'
  +'"'#10'"Separate multiple segments with semicolon ;.\n"'#10'"Literal: Text b'
  +'lock in {'#226#128#166'}. Special tag #10 for newlines. Use {{regex}} insid'
  +'e to extract data directly into the text.\n"'#10'"Logic: If a Pointer in a '
  +'segment is empty, the whole segment is skipped. If a segment has no Pointer'
  +', only literal text blocks with embedded regular expressions are processed.'
  +'\n"'#10'"Regex: {prefix {regex[index]} suffix} inside a text block. If no ['
  +'index] is specified, the first match is used.\n"'#10'"Index can be a number'
  +', [*] (join by space), or [*#10] (join by newline). If the regex finds no m'
  +'atch, the entire {'#226#128#166'} block is removed.\n"'#10'"Using ~ inside '
  +'a regex returns the entire text.\n"'#10'"Inversion: Start a segment with ! '
